GFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-03T07:19:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T14:46:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible: Godot 4.6, 4.7.2, 4.8 dev 4\nWeb single-threaded\n\n### System information\n\nGoogle Chrome 151.0.7922.173\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt seems to be present some memory leak in web builds: JS heap size constantly raise even in empty project (one Node2D on scene, without scripts).\n\nLow-level WebGL resources (WebGLFramebuffer, WebGLTexture) are accumulated over time and are never garbage collected. Multiple instances of WebGLFramebuffer and WebGLTexture remain in memory within system arrays ((object elements)[]).\n\nRetained by: request_quit, rtenv\n\nTest 40 mins:\n- JS Arrays size: 173kB -> 5468kB\n- Typed arrays: 128,411kB -> 154,102kB\n\n<img width=\"920\" height=\"303\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d572886-e83e-4a94-bc18-01b56143d7b1\" />\n<img width=\"920\" height=\"299\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52316b78-35d5-45d8-bebf-0e33a19dc452\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bb63fa5-9e61-4c2a-af86-39d20b347335\" />\n\nHeap snapshots 2,4:\n[snapshots.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31773095/snapshots.zip)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- start empty project in web\n- make heap snapshot\n- wait N-minutes with active project tab\n- make heap snapshot again\n\nresult: note that JS arrays size and Typed arrays increased\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[empty.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31769819/empty.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123134/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123134/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}